Rust paired before(C 직후 Rust, multi tcp, 100 clients, 5초, 1 run, 2026-09-05 19:28~19:31, Core `a40cb46335`; C `bindings/c/perf/results/multi/report/perf_c_multi_linux_20260905_19{28..31}*_p1rust.txt`, Rust `bindings/rust/perf/results/multi/report/` 같은 시각; 처리량 Rust/C):
